":"Du zögerst bei einem Jobangebot, obwohl das Gehalt gut ist. Sag es.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Obgleich sie vielversprechend klang, passt das Aufgabengebiet nicht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Dein Freund findet die Unternehmenskultur vielversprechend. Antworte.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Obgleich ich Berufserfahrung habe, waren die Anforderungen zu speziell.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Eine Kollegin fragt, warum du die Absage bekommen hast.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Obgleich viele Stellen frei sind, sind die Verträge oft begrenzt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Ein Bekannter fragt, wie der Arbeitsmarkt gerade ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Obgleich ich viel zu tun habe, übernehme ich sie.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Deine Chefin fragt, ob du die Angebotserstellung übernimmst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":6,"text":"Obgleich die Bezahlung stimmt, ist der Weg zu weit. — Obgleich du recht hast, würde ich es probieren.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-15-konzessivsaetze-obgleich","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":6,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr besprecht ein Jobangebot.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":5,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":54,"vword-voice-M":54,"vword-listen":54,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":6},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Absagen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":26,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":3,"w":"Anforderungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":9,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Arbeitsmärkte","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":2,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Aufzählungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Ausarbeitungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Durchführungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Einschränkungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Erwartungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Firmenkulturen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Geschäftsleitungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Grundvoraussetzungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Herausforderungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Moden","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Teambildungsaktivitäten","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Zusammenhänge","from":"vocab-plural",